WEBVTT

00:00:59.374 --> 00:01:01.860
That just makes my eyelids flutter
thinking about it.

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:06.915
But instead it’s when
they bring out the wheels of lenses.

00:01:06.915 --> 00:01:07.916
(Laughter)

00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:09.751
And they click through them all.

00:01:09.751 --> 00:01:13.121
And they want to know
which lens helps you see better.

00:01:13.922 --> 00:01:15.591
“One or two?”

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:16.642
(Laughter)

00:01:16.925 --> 00:01:18.760
“One or two?”

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:19.861
(Laughter)

00:01:20.178 --> 00:01:23.215
And they say it
in this very relaxing voice.

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:24.216
(Laughter)

00:01:24.216 --> 00:01:27.386
And there’s something about
that moment of personal attention

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:30.872
and that soft voice
that just deeply relaxes me.